"03":"Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: premium website landscape hero illustration for Twyne, an editorial writer's room. Landscape 1536x1024. Bespoke antique copperplate and woodcut illustration: an open manuscript at the lower edges transforms into finely engraved botanical illuminated marginalia, curling acanthus, slender branches and elegant fragments of manuscript paper at the outer margins. Exquisite cream engraved strokes, crosshatching and restrained tiny vermilion ink details on rich ink-black background. Sophisticated literary craftsmanship, tactile and precise, quiet contemporary art direction. Composition essential: central 50 percent of the image must remain an uninterrupted quiet dark ink-black negative space for cream headline copy, with no objects or strong lines crossing that central text zone. Ornament and open manuscript detail concentrated along bottom corners and outer margins, natural asymmetric balance, subtle falloff into black. No generated titles, no legible text, no logos, no fake app interface, no watermark, no fantasy creatures, no clutter. A striking coherent editorial image with generous breathing room, premium fine art quality.",
"04":"Use case: product-mockup. Asset type: premium conceptual website hero for Twyne, a literary writing app. Landscape 1536x1024. Museum-quality photographic paper sculpture made from layers of revised manuscript paper, forming a graceful curved passage and open doorway at the edges of the frame. Warm ivory paper cut edges, delicate real fibers, exquisite folded sheets and subtle ghost traces of editing marks without any readable text. The layers bend inward as a poetic image of writing as transformation. One precise vermilion editorial thread travels through the lower margin. Sculptural directional studio lighting produces rich warm paper shadows against ink-black. Composition essential: the central 50 percent is a quiet deeply dark ink-black opening, uninterrupted negative space for cream headline copy. Paper architecture concentrated at outer left and right edges with a restrained curved lower threshold; no white sheet crosses the central text zone. Sophisticated contemporary literary art direction, tactile real materials, elegant asymmetry, cinematic depth, visually distinct from a normal desk or book photograph. No generated titles, no readable words, no logos, no fake app UI, no watermark, no people, no clutter."};
